      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:shard_lamp",
      "text": [
        "Camp lamps that run on the lattice. Each draws a small trickle of Pulse every second from generators within **8 blocks**, and goes dark the moment it cannot pay. They hold no buffer."
      ],
      "title": "Pulse lights"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The four lamps",
      "text": [
        "- **Glow Reed**: light 10, **1 Pulse** a second.",
        "- **Shard Lamp**: light 12, **1 Pulse** a second.",
        "- **Echo Sconce**: light 11, **1 Pulse** a second. It hangs on a sturdy wall and drops if the wall goes.",
        "- **Ember Bowl**: light 14, **2 Pulse** a second.",
        "Right-click one to see whether it is lit and what it costs. A lever or redstone signal dims it at once, and a comparator reads 15 while it is lit, 0 when dark.",
        "The Spirit Lantern still lights with no Pulse at all."
      ]
    },
